/function start "Product Assessment"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/task
1
Assess a proposed hiking-gear recommendation feature. Identify user value, required inputs, privacy risks, failure modes, accessibility concerns, evidence gaps, and a smallest testable version. Do not claim access to catalogue, weather, customer, or repository data.
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK_ID}}
@wait 45
/tasks
/task inspect {{TASK_ID}}
@note Create an accountable product decision as a Human Task
@cap HTASK {(human-task-[0-9]+)}
/create-human-task "Decide whether to prototype gear recommendations" "Review the Arturo assessment. Decide whether to prototype, return for revision, or stop. Record required evidence, privacy constraints, accessibility requirements, and the next authorised action."
/human-tasks
/complete-human-task {{HTASK}} "Proceed only to a synthetic prototype after catalogue coverage, privacy, accessibility, and weather-data requirements are documented." --as "Product Owner"
/human-task {{HTASK}}
